{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":18,"code":"JOB","name":"Job","testament":"OT"},"chapter":23,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"JOB 23:1"},"Then Job answered and said, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"JOB 23:2"},"Even to day ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," my complaint bitter: my stroke is heavier than my groaning. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"JOB 23:3"},"Oh that I knew where I might find him! ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," I might come ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," to his seat! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"JOB 23:4"},"I would order ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["my"]}," cause before him, and fill my mouth with arguments. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"JOB 23:5"},"I would know the words ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," he would answer me, and understand what he would say unto me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"JOB 23:6"},"Will he plead against me with ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," great power? No; but he would put ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["strength"]}," in me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"JOB 23:7"},"There the righteous might dispute with him; so should I be delivered for ever from my judge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"JOB 23:8"},"Behold, I go forward, but he ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," not ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there;"]}," and backward, but I cannot perceive him: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"JOB 23:9"},"On the left hand, where he doth work, but I cannot behold ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him: "]},"he hideth himself on the right hand, that I cannot see ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him: "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"JOB 23:10"},"But he knoweth the way that I take: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["when"]}," he hath tried me, I shall come forth as gold. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"JOB 23:11"},"My foot hath held his steps, his way have I kept, and not declined. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"JOB 23:12"},"Neither have I gone back from the commandment of his lips; I have esteemed the words of his mouth more than my necessary ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["food. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"JOB 23:13"},"But he ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in one ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["mind,"]}," and who can turn him? and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["what"]}," his soul desireth, even ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," he doeth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"JOB 23:14"},"For he performeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["the thing that is"]}," appointed for me: and many such ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things are"]}," with him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"JOB 23:15"},"Therefore am I troubled at his presence: when I consider, I am afraid of him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"JOB 23:16"},"For God maketh my heart soft, and the Almighty troubleth me: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"JOB 23:17"},"Because I was not cut off before the darkness, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["neither"]}," hath he covered the darkness from my face. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 23:17"}]}]}
